\[
\text{Score} = w_O \cdot \frac{1}{O} + w_T \cdot \frac{T_{A*}}{T} + w_M \cdot \frac{M_{A*}}{M} + w_S \cdot S
\]

where \(T_{A*}, M_{A*}\) are the *median* values across all mazes of the same type and size. Terms are clipped to avoid outliers (runtime and memory ratios capped at 2, optimality capped at \(1/1.15 \approx 0.87\)).

